          modelNote: "Includes all 3 signature colorways (Olive, Matte Black, Cream).",
          description: 'The complete 3-piece daily rotation of our signature high-stretch ribbed tanks at a bundled collector price.',
          images: [
            "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
